TIER 2 — `data/intermediate/`  (derived JSON dumps)

  Files: chapter-level JSON exports produced by stages s01–s02 of the
  pipeline (e.g. `BPA_2024_v2_OEB_mod_utf8.json`, `OBRA CIVIL/*.json`).

  These files are structural reformulations of the raw catalog into
  a JSON schema designed by the authors. The schema, key naming, and
  organization are original contributions. The underlying field
  values still derive from ADIF (see Tier 1).

  License: **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)**.

----------------------------------------------------------------------

TIER 3 — `data/processed/`  (final query/document pairs)

  Files: `OEB_resumen.pkl`, `OEB_texto.pkl`, `OEB_resumen.json`,
  `OEB_texto.json`, and any analogous artifacts produced by stages
  s03–s08 of the pipeline (parametric expansion, formula evaluation,
  deduplication, LlamaIndex document creation, etc.).

  These are the curated retrieval benchmark artifacts. They reflect
  substantial authorial work: parametric combination, formula
  resolution, duplicate filtering, and structural annotation
  (`item_key`, `parent_key`, `ud`).

  License: **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)**.

