ATTRIBUTION TO THE UPSTREAM SOURCE (ADIF BPA)

The data in this repository derives from the publicly available price
catalog of ADIF (Administrador de Infraestructuras Ferroviarias),
published through the BPA portal at https://bpa.adif.es/bp1/. The raw
BC3 (Base de Costes de la Construcción, version 3) format is maintained
by FIEBDC (https://www.fiebdc.es/) and standardized under
FIEBDC-3/2016.

The terms under which ADIF publishes the BPA catalog have not been
verified at the time of this release. The authors release the Tier 2
and Tier 3 artifacts under CC-BY-4.0 under the good-faith assumption
that the BPA catalog is made available for public reuse with
attribution, consistent with Spanish Law 37/2007 on the reuse of
public-sector information (BOE-A-2007-19814) and its successors.

If you redistribute or transform substantial portions of any tier,
the authors recommend contacting ADIF (info@adif.es) to confirm the
applicable terms for Tier 1 (raw) content.

